r gift i'm  obligated to play the game that you're  playing or even worse i too am obligated  to be the narcissist to match your  energy  and  that destroys a relationship but when  you opt out  you're doing so lovingly you're not  saying screw you i hate you  i dislike you your gifts are whatever it  is it's simply saying hey  i'm not playing that game laura i'd love  to send you a copy of our book essential  there are 12 chapters in there 12 areas  of intentional living it's an essay  collection 150 different essays from the  minimalists and in that book there's an  entire chapter about minimalist gift  giving several essays about gifting but  with intention i think you'll enjoy that  if you enjoy our podcast we'll send you  the audiobook version of essential or if  you want the book book or the ebook  version we'll send those to you as well  did you enjoy this standalone patreon  highlight if so you can listen to full  episodes of the minimalists private  podcast available exclusively on patreon  visit patreon.com  the minimalists or click the link in the  description your support keeps our  podcast and youtube channel 100  advertisement free  [Music]

